{"speciesId":205,"names":{"fr":"Foretress","es":"Forretress","en":"Forretress","ja":"フォレトス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"Its entire body is shielded by a steel-hard shell. What lurks inside the armor is a total mystery."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It remains immova­ bly rooted to its tree. It scatters pieces of its hard shell to drive its enemies away."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"Usually found hanging on to a fat tree trunk. It shoots out bits of its shell when it sees action."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"FORRETRESS conceals itself inside its hardened steel shell. The shell is opened when the POKéMON is catching prey, but it does so at such a quick pace that the shell’s inside cannot be seen."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"FORRETRESS conceals itself inside its hardened steel shell. The shell is opened when the POKéMON is catching prey, but it does so at such a quick pace that the shell’s inside cannot be seen."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It keeps itself inside its steel shell. The shell is opened when it is catching prey, but it is so quick that the shell’s inside cannot be seen."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It remains immovably rooted to its tree. It scatters pieces of its hard shell to drive its enemies away."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Its entire body is shielded by a steel- hard shell. What lurks inside the armor is a total mystery."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It is encased in a steel shell. Its peering eyes are all that can be seen of its mysterious innards."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It is encased in a steel shell. Its peering eyes are all that can be seen of its mysterious innards."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It is encased in a steel shell. Its peering eyes are all that can be seen of its mysterious innards."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its entire body is shielded by a steel-hard shell. What lurks inside this shell is a total mystery."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It remains immovably rooted to its tree. It scatters pieces of its hard shell to drive its enemies away."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il est prisonnier d’une coquille d’acier. Ses yeux vigilants sont la seule partie visible de son corps."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It is encased in a steel shell. Its peering eyes are all that can be seen of its mysterious innards."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il est prisonnier d’une coquille d’acier. Ses yeux vigilants sont la seule partie visible de son corps."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It is encased in a steel shell. Its peering eyes are all that can be seen of its mysterious innards."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It is encased in a steel shell. Its peering eyes are all that can be seen of its mysterious innards."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It is encased in a steel shell. Its peering eyes are all that can be seen of its mysterious innards."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il est prisonnier d’une coquille d’acier. Ses yeux vigilants sont la seule partie visible de son corps."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se protege con su concha de acero de tal manera que solo se pueden ver sus ojos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It is encased in a steel shell. Its peering eyes are all that can be seen of its mysterious innards."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"鋼鉄の 殻で 守られている。 すきまから 目玉が のぞいているが 中身の 正体は ナゾのまま。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il est totalement fixé à son arbre. Il lance des morceaux de sa carapace pour faire fuir son ennemi."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Permanece inmóvil agarrado a su árbol. Dispara trozos de su dura coraza para alejar al enemigo."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It remains immovably rooted to its tree. It scatters pieces of its hard shell to drive its enemies away."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"木に くっついたまま 動かない。 硬い殻の 破片を ばらまいて 近づくものを 追い払う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Foretress se cache dans sa carapace en acier trempé. La carapace s’ouvre quand il attrape sa proie, mais cela se passe tellement vite qu’il est impossible de voir à l’intérieur."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Forretress se esconde dentro de su concha de acero reforzada. Solo la abre cuando va a atrapar a su presa, pero ocurre tan rápido que no da tiempo de ver su interior."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Forretress conceals itself inside its hardened steel shell. The shell is opened when the Pokémon is catching prey, but it does so at such a quick pace that the shell’s inside cannot be seen."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"鋼鉄の カラの 中に 本体が いる。 獲物を 捕まえる ときに カラが 開くが あまりの 速さに 中身は 見えないのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Foretress se cache dans sa carapace en acier trempé. La carapace s’ouvre quand il attrape sa proie, mais cela se passe tellement vite qu’il est impossible de voir à l’intérieur."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Forretress se esconde dentro de su concha de acero reforzada. Solo la abre cuando va a atrapar a su presa, pero ocurre tan rápido que no da tiempo de ver su interior."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Forretress conceals itself inside its hardened steel shell. The shell is opened when the Pokémon is catching prey, but it does so at such a quick pace that the shell’s inside cannot be seen."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"鋼鉄の カラの 中に 本体が いる。 獲物を 捕まえる ときに カラが 開くが あまりの 速さに 中身は 見えないのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il attaque tout ce qui s’approche d’un peu trop près en lançant des morceaux de sa coquille d’acier. Il n’a aucun contrôle sur ce réflexe."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Cuando algo se le acerca, ataca disparando fragmentos de su coraza de acero. Se trata de un puro acto reflejo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"When something approaches it, it fires off fragments of its steel shell in attack. This is not a conscious action but a conditioned reflex."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"なにかが 近付くだけで 鋼鉄の カラの破片を 撃ちだし 攻撃。 意思は なく 条件反射だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"On ne peut voir l’intérieur de sa carapace que lorsqu’il engloutit sa nourriture, mais il est si rapide que personne n’a encore jamais réussi."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"El momento en el que engulle a su presa es el único instante donde muestra su cuerpo, pero hasta ahora ningún humano lo ha visto."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"In the moment that it gulps down its prey, the inside of its shell is exposed, but to this day, no one has ever seen that sight."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"獲物を 呑み込む 一瞬だけ カラの 中身が 現れるが その 姿を 見た者は まだいない。"}],"varieties":[{"id":205,"moves":[{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[3,"level-up",15],[4,"level-up",15],[5,"level-up",15],[6,"level-up",15],[7,"level-up",15],[8,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",9],[9,"level-up",12],[10,"level-up",12],[11,"level-up",12],[12,"level-up",15],[13,"level-up",15],[14,"level-up",12],[15,"level-up",12],[16,"level-up",12],[17,"level-up",12],[18,"level-up",12],[23,"level-up",12],[25,"level-up",12],[25,"m